  "goodToKnow": "Die Wirbelsäule is the spine, literally a column (Säule) of vertebrae (Wirbel). Rückenschmerzen (back pain) are one of the most common reasons Germans take sick leave. Die Bandscheibe is a spinal disc, and der Bandscheibenvorfall a slipped disc. Figuratively, Rückgrat (backbone) means courage: Rückgrat zeigen. Plural: die Wirbelsäulen."
